<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰώδης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like verdigris,
				green</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.871
			</span></i>; of bile, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(1).107
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόνοια . . τουτὶ τὸ ἰῶδες . .
					ἀφίησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.565c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rust-coloured, ferruginous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i> Hist.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>poisonous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					2.42a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.327
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντες</span>, of serpents,
				<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.Jun.
				<u>Im.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: metaph., of persons, <i>virulent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				158
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄδ-ωδα</span>) <i>acrid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύτητες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσθμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
					<u>Ven.</u>
					36.3
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
